    "why_square": {
      "id": "why_square",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Why were 3 and 5 added?\n\nFrom:\n\n240 = 2^4 × 3 × 5\n\nthe 2-factor already appears four times.\n\nBut 3 appears once and 5 appears once.\n\nThe source's adjustment adds one copy of each:\n\n3 → 3^2\n5 → 5^2\n\nSo the result becomes:\n\n2^4 × 3^2 × 5^2\n\nwhich is:\n\n(2^2 × 3 × 5)^2\n= 60^2\n= 3600.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
